	(text "**Note: Most of the MOS Gas Sensors operate at +5V, however\n		the Jetson Orin Nano uses +3V3 Logic or +1V8 Logic.\n\n		Therefore, Gas Sensor Analog Out is Scaled from 0-5V \n		to 0-3V3 and the ADCs are operating at 3V3 to match \n		Jetson I2C Logic Levels."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
